      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a publicly installed header. I don\u0027t think this is the best place for internal macros. We have some similar macros in src/dsp/cpu.h, but for this since it\u0027s rather specific and will likely grow let\u0027s make a src/utils/bounds_safety.h header.",
      "revId": "a2a09606f96b0f1a8982cd3b04e2dfa46a7bcdc0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
