      "writtenOn": "2025-07-18T20:05:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m happy to move things into src/utils/bounds_safety.h - how do you feel about src/webp/types.h including it, or should each file include it directly?\n\nThe benefit to getting these macros from src/webp/types.h is that nearly everything includes it. \n\nIf we create src/utils/bounds_safety.h, we\u0027ll need to add the include to all of webputils\n\nHappy with either option, want to gauge your preferences",
      "parentUuid": "a810c22c_7e359df4",
      "revId": "a2a09606f96b0f1a8982cd3b04e2dfa46a7bcdc0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
